{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S13把原本“想要保证，却明白没人能保证永远”的矛盾改成“就算听到保证也会担心”，改变了人物当时的心理逻辑。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的高亮词让人扫一眼就能抓住每段叙事的关键，话与感受交替也建立了清楚的阅读节奏，尤其感受随音乐到时出现，不必一开始就面对全部信息。它用反复出现的水波、小船、声音等意象串起人物从小心靠近、害怕失去到接受不确定性的变化，感受也有更细的身体反应、音乐变化和情绪层次，不只是笼统地标注开心或难过。虽然部分地方有改写过度、意象稍显拥挤的问题，整体仍是Y更容易让普通观众边听边理解并进入情境。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "30d07bf2-29ee-4189-af68-f1f114698609", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T230553440658Z", "elapsed_seconds": 113.453, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:07:46.898673+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "160f6be1f72c1c17c97729b72909da3793351a01884882a7b05c33c6daa8bd58", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\c